<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Healthscope slips to year net loss.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Healthscope slips to year net loss.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     6.00 vs 9.82</p>
<p>    Net				 loss 4.73 vs profit 6.03</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)		nil vs 2.5</p>
<p>    Total dividend (cents)	     1.00 vs 7.00</p>
<p>    Sales				  112.95 vs 92.02</p>
<p>    Other income			   3.79 vs 2.46</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)		     loss 7.28 vs profit 9.37</p>
<p>    Abnormal items		  loss 8.80 vs nil</p>
<p>    Tax				 loss 1.93 vs loss 3.78</p>
<p>    Interest				 4.08 vs 3.41</p>
<p>    Depreciation			   4.15 vs 3.78</p>
<p>    Minorities				nil vs nil</p>
<p>NOTE: Healthscope Ltd operates private healthcare facilities and services.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373 1800</p>
